MEMBER NAME  TASK26
       ID DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TASK26.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 EMP-REC.
          05 EMPNO PIC 9(3)  VALUE 0.
          05 NAME  PIC A(20) VALUE SPACES.
          05 DEP   PIC X(20) VALUE SPACES.
          05 SAL   PIC 9(10) VALUE 0.
       77 HRA PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
       77 CCA PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
       77 SHA PIC 9(3) VALUE 250.
       77 DRA PIC 9(3) VALUE 400.
       77 PFP PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
       77 INS PIC 9(3) VALUE 500.
       77 TOTALLOW PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
       77 TOTDED PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
       77 SALPAY   PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-LINE.
           DISPLAY 'MUSKAN'.
           COMPUTE HRA = 0.50 * SAL.
           COMPUTE CCA  = 0.20 * SAL.
           COMPUTE PFP = 0.10 * SAL.
           COMPUTE TOTALLOW = HRA + CCA + SHA + DRA.
           COMPUTE TOTDED = PFP + INS.
           COMPUTE SALPAY = (SAL + TOTALLOW) - (TOTDED).
           DISPLAY SALPAY.
           STOP RUN.
MEMBER NAME  TASK27
       ID DIVISION.
