       77 GRADE PIC A  VALUE SPACES.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY 'M'.
           IF MARKS >= 80
              MOVE 'A' TO GRADE
           END-IF.
           IF MARKS >= 60
              MOVE 'B' TO GRADE
           END-IF.
           IF MARKS >= 50
              MOVE 'C' TO GRADE
           END-IF.
           IF MARKS >= 40
              MOVE 'D' TO GRADE
           ELSE
              MOVE 'D' TO GRADE
           END-IF.
           DISPLAY 'GRADE: ' GRADE.
           STOP RUN.
