MEMBER NAME  TASK25
       ID DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TASK25.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77 NUM  PIC 9(2).
       77 I    PIC 9(2).
       77 FLAG PIC X VALUE 'Y'.
       77 REM  PIC 9(2).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-LINE.
           DISPLAY 'M'.
           ACCEPT NUM.
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 2 BY 1 UNTIL I >= NUM
              DIVIDE NUM BY I REMAINDER REM
              IF REM = 0
                 MOVE 'N' TO FLAG
              END-IF.
           END-PERFORM.
           IF FLAG = 'Y'
              DISPLAY 'PRIME'
           ELSE
              DISPLAY 'NOT PRIME'
           END-IF
           STOP RUN.
MEMBER NAME  FILEHAND
       ID DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. FILEHAND.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT INFILE ASSIGN TO DD1
           ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
           ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
           FILE STATUS IS COF-STAT1.

           SELECT OUTFILE ASSIGN TO DD2
           ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
           ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
           FILE STATUS IS COF-STAT2.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD INFILE RECORDING MODE IS F.
       01 INFILE-REC.
          05 INFILE-EMPNO PIC X(4).
          05 INFILE-EMPNM PIC A(11).
          05 INFILE-EMPSAL PIC 9(5).
          05 INFILE-GENDER PIC A(1).

       FD OUTFILE RECORDING MODE IS F.
       01 OUTFILE-REC.
          05 OUTFILE-EMPNO PIC X(4).
          05 OUTFILE-EMPNM PIC A(11).
          05 OUTFILE-EMPSAL PIC 9(5).
          05 OUTFILE-GENDER PIC A(1).
          05 FILLER PIC X(59).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77 COF-STAT1 PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
       77 COF-STAT2 PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
       77 EOF PIC X(1) VALUE 'N'.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY 'MUSKAN'.
           PERFORM OPEN-PARA.
           PERFORM PROCESS-PARA UNTIL EOF = 'Y'.
           PERFORM CLOSE-PARA.
           STOP RUN.

       OPEN-PARA.
           OPEN INPUT INFILE.
           OPEN OUTPUT OUTFILE.
           READ INFILE AT END MOVE 'Y' TO EOF.
       PROCESS-PARA.
           MOVE INFILE-EMPNO TO OUTFILE-EMPNO.
           MOVE INFILE-EMPNM TO OUTFILE-EMPNM.
           MOVE INFILE-EMPSAL TO OUTFILE-EMPSAL.
           MOVE INFILE-GENDER TO OUTFILE-GENDER.
           WRITE OUTFILE-REC.
           READ INFILE AT END MOVE 'Y' TO EOF.
       CLOSE-PARA.
           CLOSE INFILE.
           CLOSE OUTFILE.
