           PERFORM OPEN-PARA.
           PERFORM PROCESS-PARA UNTIL EOF = 'Y'.
           PERFORM CLOSE-PARA.
           STOP RUN.

       OPEN-PARA.
           OPEN INPUT INFILE.
           OPEN OUTPUT OUTFILE.
           WRITE OUTFILE-REC FROM HD1.
           WRITE OUTFILE-REC FROM HD2.
           WRITE OUTFILE-REC FROM HD3.
