       PROCESS-PARA.
           MOVE INFILE-EMPNO TO OUTFILE-EMPNO.
           MOVE INFILE-EMPNM TO OUTFILE-EMPNM.
           MOVE INFILE-EMPSAL TO OUTFILE-EMPSAL.
           MOVE INFILE-PAN TO OUTFILE-PAN.
           COMPUTE ALL-TOT = ALL-TOT + INFILE-EMPSAL.
           WRITE OUTFILE-REC INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'DUPLICATE KEY'.
           MOVE SPACES TO OUTFILE-REC.
           READ INFILE AT END MOVE 'Y' TO EOF.
       CLOSE-PARA.
           WRITE OUTFILE-REC FROM FT1.
           MOVE ALL-TOT TO TOT-SAL.
           WRITE OUTFILE-REC FROM FT2.
           CLOSE INFILE.
           CLOSE OUTFILE.
