           DISPLAY 'HI I AM INSIDE CALLCON'.
           MOVE 'CALLSUB' TO VARX.
           CALL VARX USING BY CONTENT VAR1 , BY CONTENT VAR2 ,
                   BY CONTENT VAR3.
           DISPLAY 'HI AGAIN'.
           DISPLAY VAR1 , VAR2 , VAR3.
           STOP RUN.
MEMBER NAME  PTRSUB
       ID DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PTRSUB.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-PTR USAGE IS POINTER.
       01 SUB-REC.
          05 X1 PIC 9(2).
          05 Y1 PIC 9(2).
          05 Z1 PIC 9(2).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING WS-PTR.
           SET ADDRESS OF SUB-REC TO WS-PTR.
           DISPLAY 'HI SUB'.
           DISPLAY X1 , SPACE , Y1 , SPACE , Z1.
           GOBACK.
